            target: ()=>kit.exprVizActive(".exprviz-hm-container"),
            placement: "center",
            title: "Pick samples, then load",
            content: `Choose fields to add sample columns \u2014 grouped by study, so you can take a whole experiment at once \u2014 then press Load data. We've loaded one study: each row is a gene, each column a sample, and the color is its expression level. Hover any cell for the sample's study, group and factors.`,
